<title>UK: Spintab to launch $400 mln five-year bond soon.</title>
<headline>Spintab to launch $400 mln five-year bond soon.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedbank's mortgage institute Spintab will launch a $400 million five-year Eurobond on Monday, lead manager HSBC Markets said on Friday.</p>
<p>Dealers away from the lead manager said the deal was likely to be priced at around 30 basis points over U.S. Treasury notes.  </p>
<p>Spintab is rated AA3 by Moody's Investors Service.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7748</p>
</text>
